From: Shaar engineering
Subject: [PATCH] Forward Chromium tab activation to Shaar

Report TabStripModel selection changes so extension tabs.update activation reaches the app router, but ignore fallback selection caused by removing the active tab.

diff --git a/chrome/browser/shaar/windows_tabs/shaar_windows_tabs.h b/chrome/browser/shaar/windows_tabs/shaar_windows_tabs.h
--- a/chrome/browser/shaar/windows_tabs/shaar_windows_tabs.h
+++ b/chrome/browser/shaar/windows_tabs/shaar_windows_tabs.h
@@ -21,16 +21,20 @@
